WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
Quartz contains silica, made of silicon and oxygen.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
One path supplies the purified silicon in the chip.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The other supplies the vessel that holds the molten silicon.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
Purified silicon melts in the crucible.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
A single crystal grows from that liquid.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
It is sliced and polished into disks called wafers.
